    "name": {
      "value": "Greater Phantasmal Doorknob"
    },
    "source": {
      "value": "tv"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "This ornate doorknob can open doors both material and metaphysical, revealing dreams and nightmares. The spell DC of any spell cast by activating this item is 20.\n\n- - **Armor:** You gain a +1 item bonus to Thievery checks to Pick a Lock.\n- - **Weapon:** If you critically succeed at a Strike with the weapon, the target is dazzled until the end of its next turn.\n\nYou cast ghost sound.\n\nThe item bonus when affixed to armor is +2, and the spell DC is 27. On a critical hit with a weapon the doorknob is affixed to, the target is blinded until the end of its next turn.\n\n- **Frequency:** once per day\n\nYou cast phantasmal killer."
    },
